        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "What Is A Promise?",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "A `Promise` is an object standing in for an async operation's eventual outcome — a value on fulfillment, a reason on rejection."
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "kind": "flowchart",
          "spec": {
            "title": "pending",
            "rows": [
              [
                "n0"
              ],
              [
                "b0",
                "b1"
              ],
              [
                "c0_0"
              ],
              [
                "c1_0"
              ]
            ],
            "nodes": {
              "n0": {
                "text": "pending",
                "shape": "diamond"
              },
              "b0": {
                "text": "fulfilled"
              },
              "b1": {
                "text": "rejected"
              },
              "c0_0": {
                "text": "value locked in"
              },
              "c1_0": {
                "text": "reason attached"
              }
            },
            "edges": [
              {
                "from": "n0",
                "to": "b0"
              },
              {
                "from": "n0",
                "to": "b1"
              },
              {
                "from": "b0",
                "to": "c0_0"
              },
              {
                "from": "b1",
                "to": "c1_0"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "sidebox",
          "title": "Settled = Final",
          "items": [
            "settled = no longer pending",
            "state is final + immutable",
            "2nd resolve()/reject() ignored",
            "one-way transitions only"
          ],
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "The Executor",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "javascript",
          "lines": [
            "const p = new Promise((res, rej) => {",
            "  console.log('sync!'); // runs NOW",
            "  setTimeout(() => res(42), 100);",
            "});",
            "p.then(v => console.log(v)); // later"
          ],
          "runnable": false
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "executor runs synchronously, first",
            "before any `.then` is attached",
            "resolve(v) fulfills, reject(r) rejects",
            "a throw inside rejects too"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
